BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3ecd3dd2-014f-31b4-b48f-0cce69b9d861.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
